    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing puzzle gameplay meets sensual anime art.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai Casual Swap 3</strong> is a relaxing tile-swap puzzle game where you'll rearrange pieces to reveal beautifully drawn, sensual anime-style illustrations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlock 40 exclusive illustrations</strong> by completing casual puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Gallery mode</strong>: revisit your unlocked artworks anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Relaxing soundtrack</strong> and subtle sound effects designed to enhance immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Simple, satisfying mechanics</strong> perfect for unwinding after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Designed for players who enjoy laid-back gameplay with a stylish and spicy reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Complete the game to unlock a special bonus</strong> featuring extra puzzles and exclusive illustrations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 All illustrations are presented in their original, unaltered form \u2014 no filters or visual obstructions.</p></li></ul>",
